abstract: "SC-Framework is a FAIR-oriented, semi-interactive Python environment for reproducible single-cell analysis. It combines reusable analysis functions with structured Jupyter notebook workflows for single-cell RNA and ATAC data in general (e.g. scRNA-seq and scATAC-seq) as well as multi-omics data, supporting transparent, configurable and scalable analyses from data preparation to downstream interpretation."
